    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16970" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀταργατῖς</span></b> , gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῖδος</span>, acc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῖν</span> (cf. Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
			1.107
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			2.761
		</span></i>): dat. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀταργατεῖτι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(3).188
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Astypalaea</span>): also gen. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀταργάτιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BCH</u>
					6.499
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Delos</span>); dat. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀταργάτει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					1135
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Delos</span>), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀταργάτι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(3).178
				</span></i>
			
			(<span class="entity">Astypalaea</span>):—<i>Atargatis,</i> a
			Syrian divinity, <i><span class="en">
				Mnaseas
				32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				16.1.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				6
			</span></i>, etc.:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀταργάτη</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>LW</u>
				1890
			</span></i>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				16.4.27
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀτταγάθη</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
